ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2812978","source_hash":"d8ba487317ac4e370c544ff11fee92077c5dfe235d14d8d93e213e278685f7be","text":"分类MTQ29f13724665d54a300119结束"},{"id":"A38463-zh-00015","doc":"A38463","law_id":"kr-013517-236727-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2812979","source_hash":"f0c1a9bab3fb3e6263bf5f4edf6b122e5405da7112dbf7f4c8a6efc01b612509","text":"2.a. 根据《国家功勋者待遇及扶助法》第4条和第5条规定，国家功勋者及其遗属。"},{"id":"A38463-zh-00016","doc":"A38463","law_id":"kr-013517-236727-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2812980","source_hash":"58ba28cadfb0dac8d02d08c0ee8abbf41830406edbcd342e2660e0504728671a","text":"(※ 适用"},{"id":"A38463-zh-00017","doc":"A38463","law_id":"kr-013517-236727-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2812981","source_hash":"6a146ab43542338759902c69a31d4ee317f8872beb827dd749427d7becbf16ce","text":"] 2. B. 根据《五一八民主运动功勋者待遇及组织设立法》第4条和第5条，为五一八民主运动做出贡献的人员及其遗属，以及"},{"id":"A38463-zh-00018","doc":"A38463","law_id":"kr-013517-236727-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2812982","source_hash":"f35ba63491de9d5e9bf6d18d2b7dbfecdc9b171f0bd158dd48644ba9f4bcc0f7","text":"其中"},{"id":"A38463-zh-00019","doc":"A38463","law_id":"kr-013517-236727-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2812983","source_hash":"9e8145d1651138c058f5bb07723077323ee5b07bc46394b365c3a5c36afada0b","text":"属于"},{"id":"A38463-zh-00020","doc":"A38463","law_id":"kr-013517-236727-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2812984","source_hash":"f3a50cf686b3ac1b20780eec09463d2500bf8453ee7637ee13592f79936dc7f7","text":"√ 标记"},{"id":"A38463-zh-00021","doc":"A38463","law_id":"kr-013517-236727-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2812985","source_hash":"6a2ea2d53c5288649b5b827a25a4c797a92ed4942c692b8c0fa759bc6b3d951f","text":"] 2.c. 橙剂暴露后遗症患者以及根据《橙剂暴露后遗症患者援助法》第3条规定获得橙剂暴露后遗症援助的人员"},{"id":"A38463-zh-00022","doc":"A38463","law_id":